方法来对冲人工智能相关基础设施的风险。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans'&gt;BBVA 考虑使用 SRT 对冲约 5 亿美元的数据中心贷款&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BBVA Weighs SRT to Hedge About $500 Million of Data Center Loans&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:27:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着矿业繁荣，刚果推出 150 亿美元的基础设施交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-pitches-15-billion-infrastructure-deals-as-mining-booms</link><description>刚果民主共和国正在投资 150 亿美元用于铁路和其他基础设施项目，因为该国正经历铜矿开采热潮，政府希望铜矿开采将改变这个中非国家的贸易和运输。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-pitches-15-billion-infrastructure-deals-as-mining-booms'&gt;随着矿业繁荣，刚果推出 150 亿美元的基础设施交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Congo Pitches $15 Billion Infrastructure Deals as Mining Booms&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-pitches-15-billion-infrastructure-deals-as-mining-booms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:28:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>